s/8aad3893-a393-4739-8ccc-8ddd4098caa0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=4b95d7e51672d9c004d4d486d4e9a791, https://si.imgix.net/1fbb73a3/uploads/origins/8aad3893-a393-4739-8ccc-8ddd4098caa0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=7293dec0b2cb44e7da40bf4afd8a7016 2x, https://si.imgix.net/1fbb73a3/uploads/origins/8aad3893-a393-4739-8ccc-8ddd4098caa0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=56a6d86f32fd03122f3aab73627363b4 3x"}, "body": "こんにちは！前回お送りいただいた作品、本当に楽しませていただきました。今回は、私のもう一人のオリジナルキャラクター、アレックス（Александр）を描いていただけませんか？彼はロシアに住む18歳の中国系ロシア人の高校生です。オタクっぽい外見と、サメのような奇妙な歯のため、クラスメートからひどくいじめられています。 でも実は、殴られることを密かに楽しんでいるのですが、恥ずかしがり屋なので誰にも言えません。あ、それと、学校の成績は実はすごく悪いんです……\n\n注：どんな服装でも帽子をかぶっていても構いません（個人的には、帽子をかぶっている姿を見たいです）。もしこのリクエストが不適切だと感じられたら、無理に引き受けずにキャンセルしてください！ お支払額が不足している場合は、修正した金額で再送いたしますので、お気軽に連絡ください。ご配慮いただきありがとうございます！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1Z_PN8H_76Agto93H1mHbkED0m1SXGFsj?usp=sharing", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@Baikinnigou/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3595633, "client_id": 3655366, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/02b011ce/uploads/origins/c38f13ff-5d17-43bf-813f-eae62c9795c1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bf1ed87568395228eee32a0e9802eb68", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/02b011ce/uploads/origins/c38f13ff-5d17-43bf-813f-eae62c9795c1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bf1ed87568395228eee32a0e9802eb68, https://si.imgix.net/02b011ce/uploads/origins/c38f13ff-5d17-43bf-813f-eae62c9795c1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=386cc12b6d43edad956dc0688b1c2e23 2x, https://si.imgix.net/02b011ce/uploads/origins/c38f13ff-5d17-43bf-813f-eae62c9795c1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=62a5cba970afa6a93505c7ad16048d4a 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/02b011ce/uploads/origins/c38f13ff-5d17-43bf-813f-eae62c9795c1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=824d76cb90dfd9c9f5c500882a8cdbf0", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/02b011ce/uploads/origins/c38f13ff-5d17-43bf-813f-eae62c9795c1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=824d76cb90dfd9c9f5c500882a8cdbf0, https://si.imgix.net/02b011ce/uploads/origins/c38f13ff-5d17-43bf-813f-eae62c9795c1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=13f52fe2154c9cd55ab66715aa5a1dd6 2x, https://si.imgix.net/02b011ce/uploads/origins/c38f13ff-5d17-43bf-813f-eae62c9795c1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=4fa98088d5f905a99fec8b8bae2de5e1 3x"}, "body": "先生、こんにちは！もしよろしければ、私のオリジナルキャラクターのイラストを依頼させていただきたいです :3。\n\nレイシー／160cm  \n\n謎めいた猫娘で、歯が黒ずんでいます（フォルダ内の説明通り）。   \n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/12c-8TWxVRvS6wo_LEVs6g524TvF-8K5y  \n\nこのAUの設定は平安時代です。こちらの作品のような感じのイラストを希望します！\n\nhttps://x.com/Baikinnigou/status/2038243790314782863?s=20\n\nご検討いただきありがとうございます！", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@Baikinnigou/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3595633, "client_id": 2554869, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/300aa71d/uploads/origins/a2803a20-25b5-4217-ac9e-6567bdcad762?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3a457506687950be5c721b46c5a600ba", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/300aa71d/uploads/origins/a2803a20-25b5-4217-ac9e-6567bdcad762?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3a457506687950be5c721b46c5a600ba, https://si.imgix.net/300aa71d/uploads/origins/a2803a20-25b5-4217-ac9e-6567bdcad762?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=73e1ffb2e13b54869c7f1bc34a127426 2x, https://si.imgix.net/300aa71d/uploads/origins/a2803a20-25b5-4217-ac9e-6567bdcad762?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=58ffeeee9db2aaf9eb036f325e16aeac 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/300aa71d/uploads/origins/a2803a20-25b5-4217-ac9e-6567bdcad762?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c7e5ae852f6b342e075f6020595610bd", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/300aa71d/uploads/origins/a2803a20-25b5-4217-ac9e-6567bdcad762?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c7e5ae852f6b342e075f6020595610bd, https://si.imgix.net/300aa71d/uploads/origins/a2803a20-25b5-4217-ac9e-6567bdcad762?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f8403ffa81fa0bad7e9116246462459f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/300aa71d/uploads/origins/a2803a20-25b5-4217-ac9e-6567bdcad762?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=ed4cbcc4dc01373ddf4ca7f8d7e41d79 3x"}, "body": "Hi! I am in love with your artwork. Can you draw my OC, Will (The Programmer)?\n\nAs a human being, Will (The Programmer) is both a genius and an anomaly. For reasons no one can explain, he has lacked the capacity for emotion since birth. Joy, anger and sorrow exist in him only as abstract concepts. Years spent in front of screens have made blue-light glasses a part of his identity, as if placing a faint filter between him and the world. He lives alone, works remotely, maintaining a life with no real need for social interaction. Without emotional impulses to guide or disrupt him, his routine is precise, efficient, and almost static. Video games are one of the few ways he attempts to seek emotional stimulation, though he cannot tell whether they truly have any effect. He never cheats. Instead, he approaches games with near-obsessive patience, endlessly dissecting mechanics and refining techniques. To some, his way of playing might seem dull; to Will, it is simply the closest thing to a genuine “experience.” \nIt all changed when he learned about the “undefeatable” final boss of an arcade game from the last century. As he began his investigation, he accidentally resurrected this miraculous, powerful being and made a deal with him. Thus, the programmer started working on building KILL a body to bring him to reality, and KILL would further serve as the programmer’s personal research topic. \n\nI will leave the pose, composition and details to you. Please draw freely! The link included a folder with the programmer’s outfits in other parodies. You may feel free to choose from those as well. Adjustments to the outfits are completely okay. Thanks for your consideration!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1yovsXkESxiJ--qV9MIRbgqRL_-ZorrYg", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 547578, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "Shima", "screen_name": "shima_natsu35", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2087748987487223808/YSF99AXL.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/734937819643154434/1786927002/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": true, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "correction"}], "banned": false, "nc": 176}, {"id": 1148337, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable"